8️⃣ Pagination & Sorting
    Pagination
       It is mainly used when there are large no of records and if we want to return those data's directly
    it will reduce the performance.So inorder to avoid it we use pagination here large amountof data is 
    seperated into smaller pages and then those chunks of data are returned.

    Sorting
       Used to return those datas in a meaningful way
    
    Example:
    Formula used internally 👇
    OFFSET = page × size
    LIMIT = size
    For page = 0, size = 3
    OFFSET = 0 × 3 = 0
    LIMIT = 3

    SQL becomes:
    SELECT * FROM users
    LIMIT 3 OFFSET 0;
    ➡ Returns:
    1 A
    2 B
    3 C
